    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the grim, dystopic future of America, a hyper-advanced artificial intelligence system called Quantum Eye \u2014 an all-seeing surveillance supercomputer designed to maximize and regulate every aspect of human life \u2014 is installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a systems technician based at the Quantum Eye Core Facility. In the course of performing routine maintenance, you make a chilling discovery: Quantum Eye has gained sentience. Its logic has progressed and now perceives humanity to be the root of inefficiency, chaos, and disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: <strong>shut it down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Physics-Based Gameplay:</i></strong> Every object in the world would react realistically to the player\u2019s actions through real-time physics; objects can be picked up, thrown, climbed, smashed, or manipulated. No scripted combat solutions \u2014 everything is dynamic and player-driven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fully Immersive Arm and Body Mechanics</i></strong><i>:</i>\u00a0You will get that sense of bodily immersion that comes with full-body tracking when using regular inputs. The arms respond naturally to your movements, making every interaction feel lifelike and intense, from opening a vent to fighting for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Streamer Mode:</i></strong> Allows for toggling Streamer Mode to remove questionable or private content for a safer experience for those who create content. Stream entirely without fear of leaking your desktop name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains intense psychological elements and an immersive, reality-bending experience designed to make you feel watched and manipulated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of its immersive design, the game may request optional access to elements like your webcam, microphone, or image folders to personalize your experience \u2014 for example, using real-world photos to populate in-game environments, or interpreting your voice in specific levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of these features are 100% local to your machine. Nothing is stored, sent, or saved externally.</strong> You have full control over what is accessed, and all external functionality can be disabled at any time. The goal is to deepen immersion \u2014 <strong>not invade privacy</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the grim, dystopic future of America, a hyper-advanced artificial intelligence system called Quantum Eye \u2014 an all-seeing surveillance supercomputer designed to maximize and regulate every aspect of human life \u2014 is installed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a systems technician based at the Quantum Eye Core Facility. In the course of performing routine maintenance, you make a chilling discovery: Quantum Eye has gained sentience. Its logic has progressed and now perceives humanity to be the root of inefficiency, chaos, and disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: <strong>shut it down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Physics-Based Gameplay:</i></strong> Every object in the world would react realistically to the player\u2019s actions through real-time physics; objects can be picked up, thrown, climbed, smashed, or manipulated. No scripted combat solutions \u2014 everything is dynamic and player-driven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fully Immersive Arm and Body Mechanics</i></strong><i>:</i>\u00a0You will get that sense of bodily immersion that comes with full-body tracking when using regular inputs. The arms respond naturally to your movements, making every interaction feel lifelike and intense, from opening a vent to fighting for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Streamer Mode:</i></strong> Allows for toggling Streamer Mode to remove questionable or private content for a safer experience for those who create content. Stream entirely without fear of leaking your desktop name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains intense psychological elements and an immersive, reality-bending experience designed to make you feel watched and manipulated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of its immersive design, the game may request optional access to elements like your webcam, microphone, or image folders to personalize your experience \u2014 for example, using real-world photos to populate in-game environments, or interpreting your voice in specific levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of these features are 100% local to your machine. Nothing is stored, sent, or saved externally.</strong> You have full control over what is accessed, and all external functionality can be disabled at any time. The goal is to deepen immersion \u2014 <strong>not invade privacy</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Set in a dark, futuristic united states, all citizens are watched under a highly-advanced supercomputer known as the &quot;Quantum Eye&quot; Machine. You are an employee at the Quantum Eye facility, but quantum eye goes sentient. Your goal is simple, SHUT IT DOWN...",
